From 1c0de940d930691b039d45a2f822e5244c33b234 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:28:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/47] ASoC: wsa884x: port SP11 Windows speaker lifecycle

Port the accepted Surface Pro 11 WSA8845 amplifier profile and retained
three-state lifecycle onto Linux v7.3. Keep the newer scoped_guard()
locking model while preserving the Windows-derived speaker state
transitions, watchdog handling and validated analog setup.

Signed-off-by: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
